{"id":"b2a2b4650e47dbfa","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-shoenfield-semigroup.md","title":"Semigroups with Unit and Word Evaluation","display":"df-shoenfield-semigroup — Semigroups with Unit and Word Evaluation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-shoenfield-semigroup","aliases":["68-df-shoenfield-semigroup"],"display":"df-shoenfield-semigroup — Semigroups with Unit and Word Evaluation","depends_on":["[[68-df-word-process]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§10 pp.31-32 / PDF 40-41","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-shoenfield-semigroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-shoenfield-semigroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-shoenfield-semigroup — Semigroups with Unit and Word Evaluation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" href=\"?note=2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" title=\"68-df-word-process\">68-df-word-process</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10 pp.31-32 / PDF 40-41"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 是候选二元函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 是候选单位元。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为候选字母解释图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为任意候选集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 为任意集合。词、长度、空词与连接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" href=\"?note=2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" title=\"68-df-word-process\">68-df-word-process</a> 及其有限序列依赖。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}_{68}\\)</span> 的递归条款只用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\">\\(\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}\\)</span> 是下式定义的关系，可用于任意结构候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>，不要求先对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X)\\)</span> 求值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SG}_{68}(S,\\mu,e)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;S\\ne\\varnothing\\land e\\in S\\land\n\\exists g\\in S^{S^2}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mu=g\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in S\\;(g(g(x,y),z)=g(x,g(y,z)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall x\\in S\\;(g(e,x)=x\\land g(x,e)=x)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SG}_{68}(S,\\mu,e)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;S\\ne\\varnothing\\land e\\in S\\land\n\\exists g\\in S^{S^2}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mu=g\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in S\\;(g(g(x,y),z)=g(x,g(y,z)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall x\\in S\\;(g(e,x)=x\\land g(x,e)=x)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists S,\\mu,e,\\iota\\;\\bigl(M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land\\operatorname{SG}_{68}(S,\\mu,e)\\land\\iota\\in S^\\Omega\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists S,\\mu,e,\\iota\\;\\bigl(M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land\\operatorname{SG}_{68}(S,\\mu,e)\\land\\iota\\in S^\\Omega\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,\\epsilon_{68}):=e.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,\\epsilon_{68}):=e.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\land a\\in\\Omega\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X\\,^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle):=\\mu(\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X),\\iota(a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\land a\\in\\Omega\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X\\,^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle):=\\mu(\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X),\\iota(a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,X,z)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists S\\;\\exists\\mu\\in S^{S^2}\\;\\exists e\\in S\\;\\exists\\iota\\in S^\\Lambda\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;|\\Lambda|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land\\operatorname{SG}_{68}(S,\\mu,e)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists v\\in S^{\\operatorname{lh}(X)+1}\\;\\Bigl(v(0)=e\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(X)\\;\\exists a\\in S\\;((X(i),a)\\in\\iota\\land((v(i),a),v(i+1))\\in\\mu)\\bigr)\\land v(\\operatorname{lh}(X))=z\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,X,z)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists S\\;\\exists\\mu\\in S^{S^2}\\;\\exists e\\in S\\;\\exists\\iota\\in S^\\Lambda\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;|\\Lambda|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land\\operatorname{SG}_{68}(S,\\mu,e)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists v\\in S^{\\operatorname{lh}(X)+1}\\;\\Bigl(v(0)=e\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(X)\\;\\exists a\\in S\\;((X(i),a)\\in\\iota\\land((v(i),a),v(i+1))\\in\\mu)\\bigr)\\land v(\\operatorname{lh}(X))=z\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}(M,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists z\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,X,z)\\land\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,Y,z)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}(M,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists z\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,X,z)\\land\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,Y,z)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,X,z)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X)=z\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,X,z)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X)=z\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10，印刷 pp.31–32 / PDF pp.40–41 的 semigroup 明确要求单位元，现代术语通常称幺半群；这里忠实保留该条件，不沿用其他书中可能无单位的同名概念。原书 Ω-semigroup 指定每个字母代表的元素，并不要求它们生成整个 S。词求值按长度递归：空词取 e，非空词唯一拆成前缀与最后字母，故得到唯一函数。结合律和单位律给 ev(X⌢Y)=μ(ev(X),ev(Y))，空词也在适用域。</p>\n<p>新增的 EvalWord 是有限词求值序列的关系式：解释函数和乘法均由有类型的存在量词绑定，非法模型上该关系为假。WordEq 以共同求值定义词等式，供量化任意候选模型的语义后承使用。对合法 Ω-semigroup，它们与原有 ev 完全一致；没有改变半群的单位元条件或字母解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-word-process","status":"resolved","id":"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-word-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-word-process","status":"resolved","id":"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 是集合，$\\mu$ 是候选二元函数图，$e$ 是候选单位元。$\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 有限，$\\iota$ 为候选字母解释图，$M$ 为任意候选集合；$X,Y\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}$，$z$ 为任意集合。词、长度、空词与连接见 [[68-df-word-process]] 及其有限序列依赖。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SG}_{68}(S,\\mu,e)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;S\\ne\\varnothing\\land e\\in S\\land\n\\exists g\\in S^{S^2}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mu=g\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in S\\;(g(g(x,y),z)=g(x,g(y,z)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl(\\forall x\\in S\\;(g(e,x)=x\\land g(x,e)=x)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists S,\\mu,e,\\iota\\;\\bigl(M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land\\operatorname{SG}_{68}(S,\\mu,e)\\land\\iota\\in S^\\Omega\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,\\epsilon_{68}):=e.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\land a\\in\\Omega\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X\\,^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle):=\\mu(\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X),\\iota(a)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,X,z)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists S\\;\\exists\\mu\\in S^{S^2}\\;\\exists e\\in S\\;\\exists\\iota\\in S^\\Lambda\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&|\\Lambda|<\\aleph_0\\land M=(S,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\land\\operatorname{SG}_{68}(S,\\mu,e)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Lambda)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists v\\in S^{\\operatorname{lh}(X)+1}\\;\\Bigl(v(0)=e\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i<\\operatorname{lh}(X)\\;\\exists a\\in S\\;((X(i),a)\\in\\iota\\land((v(i),a),v(i+1))\\in\\mu)\\bigr)\\land v(\\operatorname{lh}(X))=z\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}(M,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists z\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,X,z)\\land\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,Y,z)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalWord}_{68}(M,X,z)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ev}_{68}(M,X)=z\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":3920,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a6560d8fe6fe304","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，见 [[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]。词与可达性见 [[68-df-word-process-reachability]]；合同性见 [[68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence]]。四元组结构与词求值取 [[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]] 的接口。$X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)$。"},{"id":"d83b2898ee4390d1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 有限，$R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^2$ 有限，$X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)$。$\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}$ 与 $\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}$ 见 [[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]]。$M$ 是任意集合候选；量化的是集合载体的结构，不量化真类。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup|df-shoenfield-semigroup — Semigroups with Unit and Word Evaluation]]"}],"outgoing":["2c2f80ef5e90c5ab"]}